# REQ-314 BA Audit Analysis Report

## Executive Summary

| Category | Findings | Severity |
|----------|----------|----------|
| Logical Contradictions | 5 critical issues | 🔴 High |
| Edge Cases | 7 unaddressed scenarios | 🟡 Medium |
| AC Traceability | 3 blocked-but-active states | 🟠 High |
